This project is a Visual Studio Code extension derived from the Sublime Text
"SystemVerilog" plugin.

Original project:
  SystemVerilog (Sublime Text plugin)
  Author: TheClams
  Source: https://github.com/TheClams/SystemVerilog
  Documentation: https://sv-doc.readthedocs.io/en/latest/
  License: Apache License 2.0

The core SystemVerilog parser (verilogutil.py) and the beautifier
(verilog_beautifier.py) were ported to TypeScript, and their test data (under
the `test/data` directory) is reused from the original project to validate the
port.

